{"seq":35,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1136"},"reason":"The sentence on Odin's eight-legged horse Sleipnir is extended with his birth from Loki (Prose Edda) and his 8th-century depictions on Gotland picture stones, so the new Sleipnir question has its sentence.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",342],["-","Sleipnir"],["+","Sleipnir,"],["=",1],["+","the best of all horses, "],["=",10],["+","According to Snorri, the grey stallion was born of Loki, who had turned himself into a mare to lure away the horse of the giant building the wall of Asgard; an eight-legged horse with a rider already gallops across picture stones carved on Gotland in the 8th century. "],["=",811]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",320],["-","Sleipnir"],["+","Sleipnir,"],["=",1],["+","das beste aller Pferde, "],["=",10],["+","Nach Snorri brachte Loki den grauen Hengst zur Welt, nachdem er sich in eine Stute verwandelt hatte, um das Pferd des Riesen fortzulocken, der die Mauer von Asgard baute; ein achtbeiniges Pferd mit Reiter galoppiert schon über Bildsteine, die im 8. Jahrhundert auf Gotland gemeißelt wurden. "],["=",785]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",266],["-","Слейпнир"],["+","Слейпнир,"],["=",1],["+","лучший из всех коней, "],["=",8],["+","По Снорри, этого серого жеребца родил Локи, обернувшийся кобылой, чтобы увести коня великана, строившего стену Асгарда; восьминогий конь со всадником скачет уже по резным камням с изображениями, высеченным на Готланде в VIII веке. "],["=",733]]}],"hash":"5ac638701b77"},
