{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28509"},"reason":"New question on Sleipnir, Odin's eight-legged horse, which the article mentioned but did not ask about; verified on Wikipedia's Sleipnir article (eight-legged horse ridden by Odin, child of Loki and Svaðilfari, depicted on two 8th-century Gotland image stones) and its Tjängvide image stone article.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sleipnir"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tj%C3%A4ngvide_image_stone"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Sleipnir"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Sleipnir"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Слейпнир"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[908,8],"de":[1019,8],"ru":[822,8]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"701","end":null,"precision":"century","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Gotland picture stones such as Tjängvide show an eight-legged horse, read as Sleipnir","labelDe":"Gotländische Bildsteine wie Tjängvide zeigen ein achtbeiniges Pferd, gedeutet als Sleipnir","labelRu":"Готландские камни-изображения, например из Чэнгвиде, показывают восьминогого коня — Слейпнира"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sleipnir","title":"Sleipnir – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"d40a02a88abd"},
{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27509"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact: New question on Sleipnir, Odin's eight-legged horse, which the article mentioned but did not ask about; verified on Wikipedia's Sleipnir article (eight-legged horse ridden by Odin, child of Loki and Svaðilfari, depicted on two 8th-century Gotland image stones) and its Tjängvide image stone article.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"What is the name of Odin's eight-legged horse, which Loki gave birth to in the shape of a mare?"},{"field":"de","new":"Wie heißt Odins achtbeiniges Pferd, das Loki in Gestalt einer Stute zur Welt brachte?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Как зовут восьминогого коня Одина, которого Локи родил в облике кобылы?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28509"}],"hash":"ca516ffc98b9"},
